# Copy to tests/cisco-sdwan/.env (gitignored) and chmod 600 it, to give the
# tests a Cisco Catalyst SD-WAN Manager (vManage) to run against, such as
# DevNet's always-on SD-WAN sandbox or a reserved one.
#
# Nothing reads these yet: The Pleiades has no SD-WAN device type, method or
# test today. This file names the settings SD-WAN work will read, so the
# sandbox can be set up before it lands. Until then filling it in runs
# nothing.
#
# The DevNet sandbox's page lists the Manager's address and its login; it is
# shared with every other visitor, so anything run against it should only
# read.
#
# The Manager's base URL (https and the host, with the port when it is not 443).
PLEIADES_E2E_SDWAN_URL=
# Its login.
PLEIADES_E2E_SDWAN_USER=
PLEIADES_E2E_SDWAN_PASS=
